  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.33333334326744 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.25 cup butter",
    "1 recipe pastry for a 9 inch double crust pie",
    "10 fresh peaches, pitted and sliced",
    "egg wash, for glazing (Optional)"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rWOlw9KaY_97IA3WoQFRoX7JXoQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12347-peach-pie-VAT-005-step-01-c772002936c449d7b0d9d27c84c94ae6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12347/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix sugar, flour, and butter together in a medium bowl until crumbly; set mixture aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2reHV6RBBqtnTZ4f8TpeCnGuyMo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12347-peach-pie-VAT-006-step-02-7dea3ce5ddef45509d89c22471b6c712.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12347/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Line the bottom and sides of a 9-inch pie plate with one pie crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mkf8QntDDEe4nSkGC7jm7pOwkmg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12347-peach-pie-VAT-007-step-03-a4b2c484ee51481db576c845f930d7e6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12347/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange a single layer of peaches in crust. Sprinkle with some of crumble mixture. Continue layering with remaining peaches and crumble mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cSPu4GX8rlRws7-Q0rTT8rRgKjU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12347-peach-pie-VAT-008-step-04-2d719d8f621e43dc9103796243f691b3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12347/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To top the pie with lattice strips: Roll the remaining crust into a 10-inch circle. Cut into twelve 3/4-inch strips with a sharp paring knife or pastry wheel. Arrange six lattice strips vertically across the pie using the shortest strips for the edges of the pie. Arrange remaining 6 strips horizontally, weaving them in an over-and-under pattern. Fold the ends of the lattice strips under the edge of the bottom crust and crimp the edges. Brush lattice with egg wash.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cz3_1YPHonW0tmk9sS3i-fDLvs0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12347-peach-pie-VAT-009-step-05-865208506af748f6a3404f4e0f2f355f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12347/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake pie in the preheated oven until peaches are bubbling and crust is golden, about 45 minutes. Allow pie to cool before slicing.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7z9xBCijsGDkTmhO21_oktsHgeM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12347-peach-pie-VAT-010-step-06-589acad20d6c4e09a4e378a0ce08b489.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12347/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice and serve.",
